Configurable billing-cycle quota reporting for up to four OPNsense WAN providers.

The plugin reads persistent vnStat counters, reports download and upload usage,
remaining quota, daily budget, projected cycle totals, and daily history. It
includes a responsive chart-led report view, settings page, API, export tools, and
dashboard widgets.
Optional consumer reports use ntopng host RRDs and correlate Insight flow bytes
with recent Unbound answers for explicitly coverage-labelled domain estimates.
